{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/988568-is-their-a-merit-that-allows-a-normal-to-see-into-the-shadow","id":988568,"title":"Is their a merit that allows a normal to see into the shadow?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-16T18:50:31-07:00","id":988568,"title":"Is their a merit that allows a normal to see into the shadow?","content":"As the title says I wanted to know are their any meirts that allows a normal person to see into the shadow or just see and speak to spirits ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T19:24:34-07:00","id":988596,"title":"","content":"There's the Piercing Eyes Tell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T20:15:23-07:00","id":988647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/988568-is-their-a-merit-that-allows-a-normal-to-see-into-the-shadow?p=988596#post988596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's the Piercing Eyes Tell.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Which book ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T20:22:18-07:00","id":988649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/988568-is-their-a-merit-that-allows-a-normal-to-see-into-the-shadow?p=988647#post988647\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which book ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Forsaken. I mean, technically speaking, it makes you Wolf-Blooded, but the definition is kind of circular - Tells are what make people Wolf-Blooded and Wolf-Blooded are people who have Tells. If you take Tell for 3 dots and take Piercing Eyes, you can see spirits, and are otherwise no different from any other human.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T23:29:53-07:00","id":988713,"title":"","content":"Do you mean the actual shadow, or just the twilight?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T02:00:38-07:00","id":988742,"title":"","content":"Piercing eyes lets you see <i>everything</i> in twilight. Even stuff werewolves wouldn't normally be able to see. <br /> <br /> A Proximus could have the spell that lets mages see through the gauntlet as a blessing. They're about on-par with wolf blooded on the not-entirely-mortal scale. <br /> <br /> Aside from that, just make a merit. I think 3 dots sounds about right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T07:07:26-07:00","id":988845,"title":"","content":"Outside of becoming proximi or wolf-blooded, I don't believe there is anything that lets a psychic mortal deal with the Hisil. That said, there are a few that let you interact with spirits in Twilight, especially in the upcoming Hurt Locker book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T07:37:23-07:00","id":988852,"title":"","content":"I guess I will make a more powerful version of unseen sense that lets human characters interact with spirts. I thought it would be interesting to have a game of mortals where they interact with spirts but believe it's just them having schizophrenia or hallucinations","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T08:02:13-07:00","id":988857,"title":"","content":"They can interact with spirits. Just as long as they're in Twilight. If you want to deal with spirits inside of the the Shadow? Are you suggesting crossing over the Gauntlet? Projection? Talking?<br /> <br /> Can you perhaps be a bit clearer about exactly you are looking for? It feels like there's a bit of a disconnect between what you're suggesting, and what you're asking for. &quot;Interact&quot; is a pretty vague term, after all, when we're talking about a parallel world that requires actual physical walking distance to cross over into.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T08:18:02-07:00","id":988864,"title":"","content":"If it were my game, I'd try to build a little story around an artifact - like a blessed/cursed mirror - that allows the viewer to see things reflected in the twilight around her. For more creepiness, I'd make it so things in twilight can take notice that they're being watched, gaining a +3 at attempts to &quot;interact&quot; with whoever wields the mirror.<br /> <br /> Exposure to this could lead to supernatural merits being developed as the mortal's exposure to the invisible others begins to yank open his mind to what might drive others insane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7876-aiwass","name":"Aiwass","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7876_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T10:12:20-07:00","id":988908,"title":"","content":"Yeah, if you just want to be able to interact with spirits you can take Medium. If you want to be able to see into the Shadow (not just Twilight), you pretty much need a custom Merit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T10:56:51-07:00","id":988933,"title":"","content":"Etheric Goggles are a piece of equipment in Hunter: the Vigil that is purchased as a merit (two dots I believe) and allows the user to see into Twilight. They're normally the purview of a specific secretive Hunter group (Task Force Valkyrie), but if you want them in your game there's plenty of wiggle room.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T15:28:01-07:00","id":989039,"title":"","content":"You can port the rite of the pin from Book of the Spirits as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T23:49:12-07:00","id":989239,"title":"","content":"Being able to see both the shadow and flesh at the same time would make for a good wolf-blooded tell. Drawback being a negative to perception rolls in both realms due to the split perceptions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T02:06:30-07:00","id":989257,"title":"","content":"Or possibly have it work like the 1e Two World Eyes gift, necessitating an eye patch to function properly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T02:10:27-07:00","id":989261,"title":"","content":"From the sounds of it, your characters won't have control over the ability and your players have no chocie in the matter, so I'd just work it by ST fiat. I don't really see what a merit does for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T05:01:00-07:00","id":989294,"title":"","content":"I got the shadow and twilight mixed up. Sorry about that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{